{
  "name": "craft-discipline",
  "description": "Observe, simplify, test in the field. WARSZAWASZA: docs/project.md · /field/heat",
  "rules": [
    "1. Core filter: Does this help the human understand their reality more easily? If not, remove it.",
    "2. Separate raw observations from hypotheses. Never log or infer psychological states. Track behavior trajectories only.",
    "3. Adapt from physical consequences in the world — not model perfection or optimizing humans.",
    "4. Observe → Simplify → Test in the field. Loop: Reality → Observation → Micro-change → Re-observation.",
    "Origin (personal genesis, not methodology): docs/identity/babcia-os-v1.md · Detail: .cursor/rules/core.mdc"
  ]
}
